{"title":"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 35","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/2/cd26f3deb215410a104d75d0a47d9549948a2c31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$695$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> is to be written with a factorial base of numeration, that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/b/2cb8385c6cbb7339c2a48c43b1e5b01d968dec61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$695=a_1+a_2\\times2!+a_3\\times3!+ \\cdots a_n \\times n!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"325\" height=\"17\" /> \nwhere <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/e/d9e3e1106d24745872eb9c10fc231a4aa45fcf36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1, a_2, a_3 \\cdots a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"112\" height=\"11\" /> are integers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/5/28519875b71ee92128e36e36b74d4004df63fae4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\le a_k \\le k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"87\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/f/63f344e7d8b14a7886fc7fb72da53cd0a3271dcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/9/d49dd830a287264222487f59cf529a3c01f65c97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n(n-1)(n-2)\\cdots2 \\times 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"193\" height=\"20\" />. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/2/5e28850813a5321d2a8ae3c0510457a7337975ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/4/e0410b07f34c6d8563b02bd76a9e18f4b67b8e9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 1\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 2\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 3\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"349\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This problem can be approached similarly to other <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Base_number\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base number\">base number</a> problems.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/b/35b2ca621e278e0bdfaf12dfda4b3de71da3196a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120 &lt; 695 &lt; 720$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"129\" height=\"13\" />, divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/2/cd26f3deb215410a104d75d0a47d9549948a2c31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$695$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/a/aaa4de95cc6371d125d5cf773cdd9f9913dd1d8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />.  The quotient is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and the remainder is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/1/0510fa96a9909623c5966ad29945fabc84c704a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$95$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, so rewrite the number as\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/5/e958c15b7790120d2b440277c388c0493ec76b9e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[695 = 5 \\cdot 120 + 95\\]\" width=\"140\" height=\"14\" />\nSimilarly, dividing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/1/0510fa96a9909623c5966ad29945fabc84c704a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$95$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e290f2cba0ba0e11c0b91630da15a408da2fcf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> results in a quotient of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and a remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/1/9a1b2497e7b125cd721bab4c6e2385f954fe35cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so the number can be rewritten as\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/3/22361232e25926724dcc62d2d798dcca527a02a8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[695 = 5 \\cdot 120 + 3 \\cdot 24 + 23\\]\" width=\"203\" height=\"14\" />\nRepeat the steps to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/1/bd1f75d71dff3aa7dee27f4c5623604dd2eb9bbd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[695 = 5 \\cdot 120 + 3 \\cdot 24 + 3 \\cdot 6 + 2 \\cdot 2 + 1\\]\" width=\"300\" height=\"14\" />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693c4044f8526a8179956e8ac7a3f2f9d61e2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />.  One can also stop at the second step by noting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/b/c0bf6d8c308eb5d8a51f376bf0203a1b96baca11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23 &lt; 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME\" title=\"1961 AHSME\">1961 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1961 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1961\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">Problem 34</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 36\">Problem 36</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">35</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 36\">36</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">37</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">38</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">39</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">40</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspa